{"de1.P4.C1": {"ly_do": "Ý b: $\\left(9x^{3}y^{4}+15x^{2}y-3xy\\right):\\left(3xy\\right)=3x^{2}y^{3}+5x-1$ vì $-3xy:\\left(3xy\\right)=-1$, không phải $-3$; đáp án B $3x^{2}y^{3}+5x-1$ đúng nên chỉ sửa lời giải. Các ý khác đã kiểm đúng: a $6x^{3}$, c $-4x^{3}-8x^{2}-5x-16$.", "parts": [{"correctAnswer": 3, "explanation": "$2{x}^{2}\\left( 3x-5 \\right)+10{x}^{2}=6{x}^{3}-10{x}^{2}+10{x}^{2}=6{x}^{3}$", "id": "a", "label": "a", "options": ["$6x^3+10x^2$", "$6x^3-20x^2$", "$6x^4$", "$6x^3$"], "points": 0.5, "question": "$2{x}^{2}\\left( 3x-5 \\right)+10{x}^{2}$", "type": "multiple_choice"}, {"correctAnswer": 1, "explanation": "$\\left( 9{x}^{3}{y}^{4}+15{x}^{2}y-3xy \\right):\\left( 3xy \\right)=3{x}^{2}{y}^{3}+5x-1$", "id": "b", "label": "b", "options": ["$3x^2y^3+5x+3$", "$3x^2y^3+5x-1$", "$3x^2y^3+5xy-3$", "$3x^2y^3+5x-3$"], "points": 0.5, "question": "$\\left( 9{x}^{3}{y}^{4}+15{x}^{2}y-3xy \\right):\\left( 3xy \\right)$", "type": "multiple_choice"}, {"correctAnswer": 2, "explanation": "$\\left( 2x+1 \\right)\\left( 2x-1 \\right)-\\left( 4{x}^{2}+5 \\right)\\left( x+3 \\right)$\n$={4x}^{2}-1-4{x}^{3}-12{x}^{2}-5x-15$\n$=-4{x}^{3}-8{x}^{2}-5x-16$", "id": "c", "label": "c", "options": ["$-4x^3-8x^2-5x+16$", "$-4x^3-8x^2+5x-16$", "$-4x^3-8x^2-5x-16$", "$-4x^3-12x^2-5x-16$"], "points": 1, "question": "$\\left( 2x+1 \\right)\\left( 2x-1 \\right)-\\left( 4{x}^{2}+5 \\right)\\left( x+3 \\right)$", "type": "multiple_choice"}], "sua_boi": "muse"}}